5.  THE CLOCK.  The probe of W-37 now carries a dc-level clock ticking at the LOCAL LAPSE.
    Different arms of the ring pass through different potential, accumulate different proper
    time, and the clock state becomes correlated with the path.
============================================================================================================

  transport carrier: 128 physical states (16 gauge states per probe position), static anti-charge at the centre
      ring potential phi(v) : 0.333  0.500  1.000  0.500  0.333  0.250  0.200  0.250
      arm A (sites 1,2,3) mean phi = 0.667 ;  arm B (sites 7,6,5) mean phi = 0.233
    R_TRANSPORT = perimeter loop       dim   128  ||O||_F   11.3137  unitarity defect  0.00e+00  distinct eigenvalues   2
    R_TRANSPORT (x) I_M (x) I_C        dim  1024  ||O||_F   32.0000  unitarity defect  0.00e+00  distinct eigenvalues   2
    clock generator C (traceless)      dim     4  ||O||_F    5.6569  Hermitian, trace +0.0e+00, not a record; distinct eigenvalues   4

    propagator check: ||eigh-route psi(T=1.3) - expm-route psi(T=1.3)|| = 7.050e-15

  (5a) AHARONOV-BOHM FRINGE CONTRAST at the recombination site 4, antipodal to the source.
       V = |P_+(4) - P_-(4)| / (P_+(4) + P_-(4)), where +/- are the two flux sectors of the
       SAME dynamics.  The bare ring is exactly symmetric, so site 4 is a DARK PORT: at
       lam=0 one flux sector arrives there and the other cancels exactly, V = 1 identically.
       Anything that distinguishes the two arms degrades it.  Metric prepared in |+>.
